WEBVTT

00:15:25.329 --> 00:15:30.329
They don't own us. When we internalize
the difference between how I feel

00:15:30.329 --> 00:15:33.996
and all my wisdom and what I do
in a values aligned action.

00:15:35.662 --> 00:15:40.204
We generate the pathway to our
best selves via our emotions.

00:15:42.787 --> 00:15:45.412
So what does this look like in practice?

00:15:46.829 --> 00:15:50.621
When you feel a strong, tough emotion,
don't raise for the emotional exits.

00:15:51.621 --> 00:15:55.037
Learn its contours, show up to
the Journal of Your Heart's.

00:15:55.996 --> 00:15:57.704
What is the emotion telling you?

00:15:59.912 --> 00:16:04.746
And try not to say I am, as in I am angry
or I am sad when you say I am,